      "resource": "mail_settings",
      "_why": "Owner-managed mail configuration page (mail-settings-page-v1). password_encrypted is included in view/create/update because the web app itself must read the ciphertext to decrypt it server-side for sendMail()/testConnection() -- no API route ever forwards password_encrypted's value back to a browser response; see docs/mail-settings.md.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "name": "view",
          "fields": [
            "id",
            "host",
            "port",
            "starttls",
            "username",
